    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">collectĭcĭus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conl-</span></b> ), or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-tĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		colligo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>collected</i>, <i>gathered
			together</i> (very rare): exercitus, <i>gathered
				hastily without selection</i>, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 7,
				3, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ignis,</span>”
				<i>fed by fuel gathered here and there</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 7, 23, 2</span></i>
			.</div>
